  "transformedHtml": "<article class=\"legal-article\" id=\"art-19\">\n  <header class=\"article-header\">\n    <h2 class=\"article-number\">Article 19</h2>\n  </header>\n  <div class=\"article-content\">\n    <div class=\"article-text\">\n      <p class=\"intro-text\">A l'article 11 de la même loi, modifié par les lois des 10 avril 1973, 4 août 1978, l'arrêté royal n° 5 du 23 octobre 1978, et les lois des 2 juillet 1981, 24 juillet 1987, 30 décembre 1988, 22 décembre 1989, 20 juillet 1991, 5 août 1992 et 1er juin 1993, sont apportées les modifications suivantes :</p>\n      <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n        <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"1°\">\n          <span class=\"provision-text\">à l'alinéa 1er les mots \" 9°, </span>\n          <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n            <li class=\"sub-provision\" data-marker=\"a)\">\n              <span class=\"provision-text\">, </span>\n            </li>\n            <li class=\"sub-provision\" data-marker=\"b)\">\n              <span class=\"provision-text\">, </span>\n            </li>\n            <li class=\"sub-provision\" data-marker=\"e)\">\n              <span class=\"provision-text\">, </span>\n            </li>\n            <li class=\"sub-provision\" data-marker=\"f)\">\n              <span class=\"provision-text\"> et </span>\n            </li>\n            <li class=\"sub-provision\" data-marker=\"i)\">\n              <span class=\"provision-text\">, </span>\n            </li>\n          </ol>\n          <span class=\"provision-text\">14°, 19°, 29°, 30°, 32°, 33°, 34°, </span>\n          <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n            <li class=\"sub-provision\" data-marker=\"a)\">\n              <span class=\"provision-text\">, </span>\n            </li>\n            <li class=\"sub-provision\" data-marker=\"c)\">\n              <span class=\"provision-text\"> et </span>\n            </li>\n            <li class=\"sub-provision\" data-marker=\"d)\">\n              <span class=\"provision-text\">, </span>\n              <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n                <li class=\"sub-provision\" data-marker=\"1)\">\n                  <span class=\"provision-text\">, </span>\n                </li>\n                <li class=\"sub-provision\" data-marker=\"2)\">\n                  <span class=\"provision-text\">, </span>\n                </li>\n                <li class=\"sub-provision\" data-marker=\"3)\">\n                  <span class=\"provision-text\">, </span>\n                </li>\n                <li class=\"sub-provision\" data-marker=\"4)\">\n                  <span class=\"provision-text\"> et </span>\n                </li>\n                <li class=\"sub-provision\" data-marker=\"5)\">\n                  <span class=\"provision-text\">, </span>\n                </li>\n              </ol>\n            </li>\n          </ol>\n          <span class=\"provision-text\">et 36° \" sont remplacés par les mots \" 9°, </span>\n          <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n            <li class=\"sub-provision\" data-marker=\"A)\">\n              <span class=\"provision-text\">, </span>\n              <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n                <li class=\"sub-provision\" data-marker=\"a)\">\n                  <span class=\"provision-text\">, </span>\n                </li>\n                <li class=\"sub-provision\" data-marker=\"b)\">\n                  <span class=\"provision-text\">, </span>\n                </li>\n                <li class=\"sub-provision\" data-marker=\"e)\">\n                  <span class=\"provision-text\"> et </span>\n                </li>\n                <li class=\"sub-provision\" data-marker=\"f)\">\n                  <span class=\"provision-text\"> et </span>\n                </li>\n              </ol>\n            </li>\n            <li class=\"sub-provision\" data-marker=\"B)\">\n              <span class=\"provision-text\">, </span>\n              <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n                <li class=\"sub-provision\" data-marker=\"b)\">\n                  <span class=\"provision-text\">, </span>\n                </li>\n                <li class=\"sub-provision\" data-marker=\"c)\">\n                  <span class=\"provision-text\"> et </span>\n                </li>\n                <li class=\"sub-provision\" data-marker=\"d)\">\n                  <span class=\"provision-text\">, </span>\n                </li>\n              </ol>\n            </li>\n          </ol>\n          <span class=\"provision-text\">14°, 29°, 30°, a), 32°, 33° et 36° \";</span>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"2°\">\n          <span class=\"provision-text\">l'alinéa 2 est abrogé;</span>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"3°\">\n          <span class=\"provision-text\">l'alinéa 3 est remplacé par la disposition suivante : \" En ce qui concerne les infractions visées à l'article 1erbis, 1°, 2°, 3°, </span>\n          <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n            <li class=\"sub-provision\" data-marker=\"b)\">\n              <span class=\"provision-text\">, </span>\n            </li>\n          </ol>\n          <span class=\"provision-text\">4°, 5°, </span>\n          <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n            <li class=\"sub-provision\" data-marker=\"A)\">\n              <span class=\"provision-text\">, </span>\n              <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n                <li class=\"sub-provision\" data-marker=\"a)\">\n                  <span class=\"provision-text\">, </span>\n                </li>\n                <li class=\"sub-provision\" data-marker=\"b)\">\n                  <span class=\"provision-text\"> et </span>\n                </li>\n                <li class=\"sub-provision\" data-marker=\"d)\">\n                  <span class=\"provision-text\">, </span>\n                </li>\n              </ol>\n            </li>\n            <li class=\"sub-provision\" data-marker=\"B)\">\n              <span class=\"provision-text\">, </span>\n              <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n                <li class=\"sub-provision\" data-marker=\"a)\">\n                  <span class=\"provision-text\">, </span>\n                </li>\n                <li class=\"sub-provision\" data-marker=\"b)\">\n                  <span class=\"provision-text\">, </span>\n                </li>\n                <li class=\"sub-provision\" data-marker=\"e)\">\n                  <span class=\"provision-text\"> et </span>\n                </li>\n                <li class=\"sub-provision\" data-marker=\"f)\">\n                  <span class=\"provision-text\"> et </span>\n                </li>\n              </ol>\n            </li>\n          </ol>\n          <span class=\"provision-text\">6°, </span>\n          <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n            <li class=\"sub-provision\" data-marker=\"a)\">\n              <span class=\"provision-text\">, </span>\n            </li>\n            <li class=\"sub-provision\" data-marker=\"b)\">\n              <span class=\"provision-text\">, </span>\n            </li>\n            <li class=\"sub-provision\" data-marker=\"c)\">\n              <span class=\"provision-text\">, </span>\n            </li>\n            <li class=\"sub-provision\" data-marker=\"d)\">\n              <span class=\"provision-text\"> et </span>\n            </li>\n            <li class=\"sub-provision\" data-marker=\"e)\">\n              <span class=\"provision-text\">, </span>\n            </li>\n          </ol>\n          <span class=\"provision-text\">l'amende administrative est multipliée par le nombre de personnes pour lesquelles les dispositions visées dans cet article ont été violées, sans que son montant puisse excéder 4 000 000 francs; ce maximum n'est pas d'application à l'infraction visée à l'article 1erbis, 1°, a). \"</span>\n        </li>\n      </ol>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</article>",
